      "content": "I see. You're leaning towards Julian and Chloe for that specific \"commanding\" and \"assured\" feel. I guess I'm wondering why you're deprioritizing Marcus and Aarav for the leadership side of things. On paper, they're just as qualified with top-tier MBAs and years of experience. Is there something in their professional profiles or the way they're described that makes them seem less likely to command respect in a room full of old-school, traditional executives compared to Julian or Chloe?",
